{
  "name": "Request a review on WhatsApp after delivery with an approved template",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "9c546f13-a1d8-4b26-9e42-0841ce583b39",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ask for a review on WhatsApp after delivery\n\nWaits a few days after an order is delivered and sends one approved template with a review link button, only if the customer opted in.\n\n### How it works\n1. Your shop POSTs {order_id, phone, name, marketing_opt_in} when an order is delivered.\n2. A Code node validates the event and the opt-in flag; the webhook answers at once.\n3. The workflow waits (default 3 days).\n4. A WhatsApp template with a URL button is sent and the request is logged in Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Create a template review_request with one body variable (name) and a URL button with a variable suffix, e.g. https://example.com/review/{{1}}. Wait for approval.\n2. Credentials: WhatsApp Business Cloud and Google Sheets. Set phone number id and spreadsheet (tab \"Review requests\": order_id, phone, sent_at, message_id).\n3. Change the wait time in the Wait node if needed.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7c00dbd9-3592-4bbc-bb20-00ce3fe1ae22",
      "name": "Meta rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Meta rules\n- A review request sent days later is outside the 24 hour window, so it must be an **approved template**.\n- Meta may classify it as **marketing**, which costs more than utility and needs **marketing opt-in**. Ask for that at checkout; do not assume order opt-in covers it.\n- Send once per order. Most review platforms forbid rewarding only positive reviews.\n- Honour STOP requests: check your opt-out list before sending.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d562944d-ddda-459a-ade2-0156a3a0ae4c",
      "name": "Section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Validate, wait, send, log",
        "height": 60,
        "width": 1580
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33c218d7-23e8-4589-8fc9-20f9456e8b01",
      "name": "Delivered webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        160
      ],
      "webhookId": "b8728f5a-5a1c-4a19-9d82-571b41f39487",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "whatsapp-review-request",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aa46f4b7-777c-4dec-b9fd-482f31d776f8",
      "name": "Validate event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const b = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nconst phone = String(b.phone || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\nconst ok = phone.length >= 8 && !!b.order_id && (b.marketing_opt_in === true || b.marketing_opt_in === 'true');\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ok, order_id: String(b.order_id || ''), phone, name: String(b.name || 'there').trim(),\n  // value for the template's URL button variable (appended to your fixed review URL)\n  review_suffix: encodeURIComponent(String(b.order_id || '')),\n  lang: b.lang || 'en',\n  error: ok ? '' : 'Missing phone or order_id, or no marketing opt-in',\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7242d4e5-c814-4a2a-86df-ce5b1c65c99b",
      "name": "Valid and opted in?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "0064f12e-52e6-4eb8-a516-e5197819e843",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8cc5399a-118b-4bac-9670-2a4a99949d31",
      "name": "Respond accepted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"ok\": true } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b42869a3-f6c7-42f1-902d-eb61dad2bf17",
      "name": "Wait 3 days",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        920,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "f485b77e-a39e-4315-98bd-92ab984aa22b",
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "days"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8fd07d06-8595-4425-bbe5-d559560041ef",
      "name": "Send review template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1160,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "operation": "sendTemplate",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('Validate event').item.json.phone }}",
        "template": "={{ 'review_request|' + $('Validate event').item.json.lang }}",
        "components": {
          "component": [
            {
              "type": "body",
              "bodyParameters": {
                "parameter": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "={{ $('Validate event').item.json.name }}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "sub_type": "url",
              "index": 0,
              "buttonParameters": {
                "parameter": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "={{ $('Validate event').item.json.review_suffix }}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "49c06be9-71b1-44a2-9441-80cd4e83c44a",
      "name": "Build log row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1400,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const src = $('Validate event').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  order_id: src.order_id, phone: src.phone,\n  sent_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n  message_id: $input.first().json.messages?.[0]?.id || '',\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "98948952-dc04-464c-ac0d-205c83597973",
      "name": "Log request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        1640,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Review requests",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "49787068-a9c3-4444-b979-85017156f8fc",
      "name": "Respond error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"ok\": false, \"error\": $json.error } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Delivered webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validate event",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validate event": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Valid and opted in?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Valid and opted in?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond accepted",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Respond accepted": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait 3 days",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Wait 3 days": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send review template",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send review template": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build log row",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build log row": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log request",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "active": false,
  "tags": []
}